        "text": "We will develop a variety of trendy fruit designs for the remote control."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#6",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "We went with shape because we were having fun with the play-dough."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#7",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "Yeah the broccoli I guess wins."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#8",
